    "Industry classification is a current snapshot applied to history, not a point-in-time industry series.",
    "D3 checks every pairwise average monthly cross-sectional rank correlation among the three components; the audited maximum before preregistration was 0.19742 over 52 months.",
    "All three components must be non-null; no filling and no fallback to any single factor or pair is used."
